WEBVTT

00:09:59.762 --> 00:10:03.807
click, up, down, left, right,
menu, back, etc.

00:10:04.642 --> 00:10:07.895
But what's really amazing
is that to some degree,

00:10:07.936 --> 00:10:09.355
this process,

00:10:09.396 --> 00:10:11.565
our brain signals, are universal.

00:10:12.316 --> 00:10:14.860
So the brain signal
for “Press down your foot” for me

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:17.029
is the same as it is for you.

00:10:18.113 --> 00:10:20.949
Now this means that we're creating
a dictionary of the brain

00:10:20.949 --> 00:10:22.618
across all humans.

00:10:23.327 --> 00:10:25.829
This is going to make BCI truly scalable.

00:10:29.166 --> 00:10:30.709
As Philip once said to me,